# Canonical identity for this repo's history. Commits from 2026-05-16 through
# 2026-08-11 were authored under git's placeholder identity because a repo-local
# user.name/user.email was set in .git/config; earlier commits used a machine
# hostname address and a short-name variant. History is not rewritten (the repo
# is deployed from), so this maps every variant to one person for git shortlog,
# git log --use-mailmap, and GitHub's contributor views.
